    example: {
      t: "The leaked key",
      body: "A prototype calls an LLM provider directly from browser JavaScript with the key embedded, because it is faster to build. Within days the key appears in a public repository and usage costs spike. The architecture, not the developer, was the problem: secrets on the client are not secrets. A thin backend endpoint that forwards the request and holds the key fixes it.",
